                  <outline text="Poke all over with a fork. " />
                  <outline text="Broil, flipping halfway through, until lightly browned, 1-2 minutes per side." _note="TIP: Tortillas brown quickly! Keep a close eye on them." />
                  <outline text="" />
                </outline>
                <outline text="Assemble Tostadas">
                  <outline text="Spread tortillas with beans. " />
