          <outline text="Action Plan">
            <outline text="Look at past meal plans (see calendar / Google Photo screenshots, etc)" />
            <outline text="Potential Criteria">
              <outline text="Balance it out so you don't have dishes that compete for dishware or overly time-consuming dishes in the same playlist." />
              <outline text="Can one of them always have leftovers for Friday?" />
            </outline>
            <outline text="List out meals and shopping list for a week of food." />
          </outline>
          <outline text="About">
            <outline text="Struggling to plan meals for the week? Copy one of these!" />
            <outline text="The ingredients are all pre-organized by store, all you need to do is add in toiletries to the grocery list." />
            <outline text="This will also help control food costs as the total will be more predictable." />
          </outline>
